{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o013b","title":"王凌任车骑将军","accounts":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o013b-account","label":"《三少帝纪》正文","text":"王凌任车骑将军","evidence":["shaodi-e-o013b-q"]},{"id":"wgc-a-0-e18","label":"正文 · 正始二年","text":"王凌进封南乡侯迁车骑将军","evidence":["wgc-q0161","wgc-q0005"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0004","role":"受任","evidence":["shaodi-e-o013b-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":241,"label":"六月己卯","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"shaodi-y241","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"shaodi-q-o012","basis":"六月己卯"},"evidence":["shaodi-e-o013b-q","shaodi-q-o012","shaodi-q-b-f56b355cff79244bd89c"]},"ordering_evidence":"shaodi-e-o013b-q","source_order":[4,60,"O013b"],"order":1002}],"persons":[{"id":"shaodi-p0004","name":"王凌","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o013b-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-0cd1e6082bde64409582","layer":"original","quote":"夏五月，吴将朱然等围襄阳之樊城，太傅司马宣王率众拒之。﹝一﹞六月，辛丑〖5〗，退。己卯〖6〗，以征东将军王凌为车骑将军〖7〗。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":59,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":63,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-b-f56b355cff79244bd89c","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-f56b355cff79244bd89c","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：正始二年（公元 241）。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":62,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-bf9ccbeb544f540e6afb","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o012","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-33e60ac0c003858f0640","layer":"original","quote":"二年春二月〖1〗，帝初通《论语》〖2〗。使太常以太牢祭孔子于辟雍〖3〗，以颜渊配〖4〗。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":58,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":44,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0005","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-280a1e8d1f852b5e78af","layer":"original","quote":"二年〖1〗，吴大将全琮数万众寇芍陂〖2〗。凌率诸军逆讨，与贼争塘，力战连日，贼退走。进封南乡侯，邑千三百五十户；迁车骑将军，仪同三司。","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":21,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":67,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0161","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-280a1e8d1f852b5e78af","layer":"original","quote":"进封南乡侯，邑千三百五十户；迁车骑将军，仪同三司","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":21,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":42,"end":66,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
